en.post_comunidad:
Hi all. I am sharing Jelly Warriors, a sandbox battle simulator that plays in the browser, with no downloads or sign-up. You place jelly warriors, press Fight and watch the chaos. It has a Challenge mode with levels and a Sandbox mode to build both sides with up to 5,000 gold, plus 8 Legends with powers (Zeus, Medusa, Anubis, Hercules, Merlin, Robin Hood, La Llorona and Dracula).

I would love to know: which Legend feels the most broken? Which character or power would you like to see in a new pack?

